construction	FIPS202	run	FIPS 202, transcribed. One line per PDF page and every Greek letter absent, so §1 of the artifact carries the transcription caveat
steps	KECCAKSUM	run	keccak.team specifications summary, raw. The pseudocode, the rotation offset table, and the round-count law
margin	KECCAKCRYPT	run	keccak.team third-party cryptanalysis summary, raw. RFC 9861 cites this page as [KECCAK_CRYPTANALYSIS]. Best published unkeyed attack reaches 6 of 24 rounds, best keyed attack 9. Four pins stand beside it: KECCAKMARGIN the team own margin claim, KECCAKCRUNCHY the practical-complexity record, RFC9861 the standardised 12-round instance, KECCAKKRAVATTE the Farfalle deck function at 6 rounds
vectors	KECCAKIV1600	run	XKCP intermediate values for Keccak-f[1600], raw at commit 100f55d1. Round constants, rho offsets, and the state after each of theta rho pi chi iota for all 24 rounds of two chained examples. KECCAKIV800, KECCAKIV400 and KECCAKIV200 stand beside it for b=800, 400, 200. Permutation vectors only: no message, no padding, no digest. XKCP publishes no intermediate-value file for b=25, 50 or 100
